{"id":"0dcffad0-4756-46be-9f3c-51e7ae769331","rule_id":"d4b73fa0-9d43-465e-b8bf-50230da6718b","name":"【默认】双端用户异常登录源地址（机器学习）","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":210,"revision":9,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:19.479Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:34.211Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"15m","from":"now-30m","to":"now","description":"机器学习：用户从罕见源地址登录。适用于跨平台认证日志。对应需求：异常登录源地址。","tags":["操作系统: 双端","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":">=1.18.0"},{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"},{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n用户从异常源地址登录。\n\n### 为何重要\n常见于账号盗用。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 联系用户确认。\n2. 比对历史常用地址。\n3. 不确认则禁用并溯源。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["用户更换网络/VPN 出口"],"references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"machine_learning","anomaly_threshold":75,"machine_learning_job_id":["auth_rare_source_ip_for_a_user_ea"]}
